## 4.2 Identification of the Deep Binding Pocket

Potential ligand-binding pockets were identified using **P2Rank v2.5.1**. Analysis of the predicted pockets in the context of the three MexB conformational states identified a functionally relevant pocket within the porter domain of the Binding-state structure.

